{"site":"douban","sid":"30482958","imdb_id":"tt9892936","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt9892936/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/30482958/","chinese_title":"百年孤独 第一季","foreign_title":"Cien años de soledad Season 1","year":"2024","aka":["Cien años de soledad: Parte 1","One Hundred Years of Solitude","One Hundred Years of Solitude: Part 1","百年孤寂","百年孤寂：第一部(台)"],"region":["哥伦比亚"],"genre":["剧情","历史","奇幻"],"language":["西班牙语"],"playdate":["2024-12-11(美国)"],"episodes":"8","duration":"65分钟","description":"何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚和乌苏拉·伊瓜兰这对表兄妹不顾父母的反对结婚了，他们离开了村庄，踏上了寻找新家园的漫长旅程。在朋友和冒险家的陪伴下，他们最终在一条有史前石头的河岸旁建立了一座乌托邦小镇，并将其命名为马孔多。布恩迪亚家族的几代人将决定这座神话小镇的未来，他们饱受疯狂、不可能的爱情、血腥荒谬的战争以及对可怕诅咒的恐惧的折磨，而诅咒将让他们绝望地度过百年孤独。\n《百年孤独》出版于1967年，是1982年诺贝尔文学奖得主加夫列尔·加西亚·马尔克斯的代表作之一。该书被誉为西班牙裔美国文学和世界文学的杰作，获得了广泛的好评，销量超过5000万册，被翻译成40多种语言。","poster":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p2913960454.jpg","douban_votes":"74976","douban_rating":"9.2","imdb_rating_average":"8.3","imdb_votes":"21080","imdb_rating":"8.3 / 10 from 21,080 users","director":[{"name":"亚历克斯·加西亚·洛佩斯 Alex Garcia Lopez","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27588542/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/a094f4542089d2488640b5c3cd7ea66b.jpg"},{"name":"劳拉·莫拉·奥尔特加 Laura Mora Ortega","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/34659020/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/283cc5551df0aae58f7fcba2fe03b540.jpg"}],"writer":[{"name":"约瑟·里韦拉 Jose Rivera","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27415373/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/30ddb0afe54e038f157c5ec2f4de9af5.jpg"},{"name":"娜塔莉亚·桑塔 Natalia Santa","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/37064897/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/f5f8df435021703bef4238d7c2edca31.jpg"},{"name":"卡米拉·布鲁日 Camila Brugés","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/36695756/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar"